---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Architecture" description="Evidentia system architecture: TypeScript monorepo on Node.js 24 with an embedded SQLite store, a framework-free core engine (knowledge, retrieval, readiness, governance, providers, observatory, publishing), a CLI, a server-rendered governance console, a static website and an Agent Skill." path="/architecture" pageType="TechArticle" breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Architecture', path: '/architecture' }]}>
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Architecture</span>
    <h1>A small, legible system you can run on a laptop and audit in an afternoon.</h1>
    <p class="lede">No PHP, no Redis, no vector database, no client-side framework. Node.js 24 supplies SQLite, cryptography and the test runner; the core engine adds schema validation and YAML. Everything else is our code — and it is all tested.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="block"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="diagram scroll" tabindex="0" role="img" aria-label="Evidentia component diagram: surfaces (CLI, console, Agent Skill) call the core engine, which uses SQLite and reaches model providers and publishing targets through a hardened outbound client">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 960 560" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <defs><marker id="arr" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" fill="#3a424c"/></marker></defs>
        <g font-size="13" fill="#101418">
          <text x="24" y="30" font-weight="700" font-size="12" fill="#6b7480" letter-spacing="2">SURFACES</text>
          <rect x="24" y="44" width="200" height="56" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#d8dde3"/><text x="40" y="68" font-weight="600">evidentia CLI</text><text x="40" y="88" fill="#6b7480">JSON output · used by CI and the skill</text>
          <rect x="248" y="44" width="220" height="56" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#d8dde3"/><text x="264" y="68" font-weight="600">Governance console</text><text x="264" y="88" fill="#6b7480">Hono SSR · CSP · RBAC · CSRF</text>
          <rect x="492" y="44" width="200" height="56" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#d8dde3"/><text x="508" y="68" font-weight="600">Agent Skill</text><text x="508" y="88" fill="#6b7480">Claude Code · modes · guardrails</text>
          <rect x="716" y="44" width="220" height="56" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#d8dde3"/><text x="732" y="68" font-weight="600">Public website</text><text x="732" y="88" fill="#6b7480">Astro static · no scripts</text>

          <text x="24" y="150" font-weight="700" font-size="12" fill="#6b7480" letter-spacing="2">CORE ENGINE (packages/core)</text>
          <rect x="24" y="164" width="912" height="220" rx="12" fill="#f2f0ea" stroke="#d8dde3"/>
          <g>
            <rect x="44" y="184" width="200" height="52" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#d8dde3"/><text x="58" y="206" font-weight="600">knowledge</text><text x="58" y="224" fill="#6b7480">extract · chunk · claims · entities</text>
            <rect x="264" y="184" width="200" height="52" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#d8dde3"/><text x="278" y="206" font-weight="600">retrieval</text><text x="278" y="224" fill="#6b7480">BM25 + vectors · RRF · citations</text>
            <rect x="484" y="184" width="200" height="52" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#d8dde3"/><text x="498" y="206" font-weight="600">geo</text><text x="498" y="224" fill="#6b7480">robots per agent · readiness-v1</text>
            <rect x="704" y="184" width="212" height="52" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#d8dde3"/><text x="718" y="206" font-weight="600">content</text><text x="718" y="224" fill="#6b7480">grounded prompts · verification</text>
            <rect x="44" y="252" width="200" height="52" rx="8" fill="#e3f1ef" stroke="#0f6e6a"/><text x="58" y="274" font-weight="600">governance</text><text x="58" y="292" fill="#3a424c">policy · registers · approvals</text>
            <rect x="264" y="252" width="200" height="52" rx="8" fill="#e3f1ef" stroke="#0f6e6a"/><text x="278" y="274" font-weight="600">audit ledger</text><text x="278" y="292" fill="#3a424c">hash chain · verify</text>
            <rect x="484" y="252" width="200" height="52" rx="8" fill="#e3f1ef" stroke="#0f6e6a"/><text x="498" y="274" font-weight="600">providers</text><text x="498" y="292" fill="#3a424c">adapters · policy router · cost</text>
            <rect x="704" y="252" width="212" height="52" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#d8dde3"/><text x="718" y="274" font-weight="600">publishing · observatory</text><text x="718" y="292" fill="#6b7480">pipeline · manifests · sampling</text>
            <rect x="44" y="320" width="872" height="44" rx="8" fill="#101418"/><text x="58" y="347" fill="#fff" font-weight="600">storage: SQLite (node:sqlite, FTS5, WAL, secure_delete) · migrations append-only · tenant id on every row</text>
