          <rect x="648" y="444" width="288" height="56" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#d8dde3"/><text x="664" y="468" font-weight="600">Web pages to analyse or ingest</text><text x="664" y="488" fill="#6b7480">https only · no private ranges · size caps</text>
          <g stroke="#3a424c" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arr)"><line x1="124" y1="100" x2="124" y2="162"/><line x1="358" y1="100" x2="358" y2="162"/><line x1="592" y1="100" x2="592" y2="162"/><line x1="164" y1="384" x2="164" y2="442"/><line x1="476" y1="384" x2="476" y2="442"/><line x1="792" y1="384" x2="792" y2="442"/></g>
          <text x="24" y="540" fill="#6b7480" font-size="12">Every arrow into the core is audited; every arrow out is policy-checked and SSRF-hardened.</text>
        </g>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="block"><div class="wrap prose">
    <h2>Decisions on record</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>ADR-0001 Product identity.</strong> Evidentia; vocabulary of Knowledge, Evidence, Readiness, Observatory, Gate, Register, Ledger, Policy.</li>
      <li><strong>ADR-0002 Stack.</strong> TypeScript monorepo, Node ≥ 24, SQLite store, framework-free core, Hono console, Astro website; PostgreSQL adapter deferred.</li>
      <li><strong>ADR-0003 Clean room.</strong> GEOFlow studied for ideas; no code, prompts, templates or text copied; attribution given voluntarily.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Data model</h2>
    <p>Sources → documents → chunks (FTS + embedding) → claims and entities; drafts → publications; AI systems, model registry, processing records, approvals; query sets → observations; model calls; audit events. Fourteen tables, six append-only migrations.</p>
    <h2>Operational shape</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>One process, one SQLite file per deployment (or per tenant); WAL mode; backups by file copy.</li>
      <li>CLI for everything, console for people, skill for agents — all through the same services and the same ledger.</li>
      <li>CI: typecheck, unit/integration tests, deterministic evals, offline smoke flow, browser tests, audits, licence gate, SBOM, secret scan, SAST.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><a href="/docs">Documentation →</a></p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
